# Cursor Editor — Settings & Configuration

## Overview

Cursor extends VSCode's settings system, providing hundreds of configurable options for the editor, agent behavior, terminal, and AI-specific features. Settings are stored in JSON files with comment support.

---

## Settings File Locations

| OS | User Settings Path | Workspace Settings Path |
|---|---|---|
| **Windows** | `%APPDATA%\Cursor\User\settings.json` | `.vscode/settings.json` |
| **macOS** | `~/Library/Application Support/Cursor/User/settings.json` | `.vscode/settings.json` |
| **Linux** | `~/.config/Cursor/User/settings.json` | `.vscode/settings.json` |

### User vs Workspace Settings

| Level | Scope | Location | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| **User** | Applies globally to all projects | `settings.json` in user data directory | Lower (can be overridden) |
| **Workspace** | Applies only to the current project | `.vscode/settings.json` in repo root | Higher (overrides user) |

---

## Settings Categories

### Editor Settings

| Setting | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `editor.fontSize` | number | 14 | Font size in pixels |
| `editor.tabSize` | number | 2 | Number of spaces per tab |
| `editor.wordWrap` | string | "off" | Wrap lines ("off", "on", "wordWrapColumn", "bounded") |
| `editor.formatOnSave` | boolean | false | Format code when saving |
| `editor.minimap.enabled` | boolean | true | Show the minimap |
| `editor.lineNumbers` | string | "on" | Line number display ("on", "off", "relative", "interval") |
| `editor.bracketPairColorization.enabled` | boolean | true | Enable bracket pair colorization |
| `editor.cursorStyle` | string | "line" | Cursor style ("line", "block", "underline", "line-thin", "block-outline", "underline-thin") |
| `editor.smoothScrolling` | boolean | false | Enable smooth scrolling |
| `editor.autoClosingBrackets` | string | "always" | Auto-close brackets ("always", "languageDefined", "beforeWhitespace", "never") |
| `editor.autoClosingQuotes` | string | "always" | Auto-close quotes |
| `editor.suggestOnTriggerCharacters` | boolean | true | Auto-suggest on trigger characters |
| `editor.quickSuggestions` | boolean | true | Enable quick suggestions |

### Workbench Settings

| Setting | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `workbench.colorTheme` | string | "Default Modern Dark" | Active color theme |
| `workbench.iconTheme` | string | "default" | Active icon theme |
| `workbench.sideBar.location` | string | "left" | Sidebar position ("left", "right") |
| `workbench.activityBar.visible` | boolean | true | Show activity bar |
| `workbench.editor.enablePreview` | boolean | true | Open files as preview |
| `workbench.panel.defaultLocation` | string | "bottom" | Panel position ("bottom", "right") |

### File Settings

| Setting | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `files.autoSave` | string | "off" | Auto-save behavior ("off", "afterDelay", "onFocusChange", "onWindowChange") |
| `files.autoSaveDelay` | number | 1000 | Auto-save delay in ms |
| `files.exclude` | object | default patterns | Files to hide from Explorer |
| `files.associations` | object | {} | File extension to language associations |
| `files.trimTrailingWhitespace` | boolean | false | Trim trailing whitespace on save |
| `files.insertFinalNewline` | boolean | false | Insert final newline on save |
| `files.maxMemoryForLargeFiles` | number | 4096 | Memory limit for large files in MB |

### Terminal Settings

| Setting | Type | Default | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `terminal.integrated.fontSize` | number | undefined | Terminal font size |
| `terminal.integrated.fontFamily` | string | undefined | Terminal font family |
| `terminal.integrated.shell.windows` | string | undefined | Default Windows shell path |
| `terminal.integrated.shell.osx` | string | undefined | Default macOS shell path |
| `terminal.integrated.shell.linux` | string | undefined | Default Linux shell path |
| `terminal.integrated.cursorStyle` | string | "block" | Terminal cursor style |
| `terminal.integrated.cursorBlinking` | boolean | false | Terminal cursor blinking |

### Cursor-Specific Settings

Settings prefixed with `cursor.` or `aipopup.` control AI-specific behavior:

| Setting | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `cursor.*` | var | Cursor AI-specific settings |
| `aipopup.*` | var | AI popup behavior settings |
| Attribution control | UI-based | **CLI agent**: `~/.cursor/cli-config.json`; **IDE agent**: Cursor Settings > Agent > Attribution |

